@startuml monitoring
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #888
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

title Admin Monitoring: Theo dõi user online realtime

actor Admin
participant "OnlinePresence\nCard (.tsx)" as UI
participant "AdminMonitoring\nController" as REST
participant "PresenceGateway\n(WebSocket)" as WS
participant "PresenceService" as Svc
collections "connections Map\n(in-memory)" as Mem
collections "publicVisitors Map\n(TTL 45s)" as Pub

== 1. Lần đầu mở dashboard (REST snapshot) ==

Admin -> UI : mở /admin
UI -> REST : GET /admin/monitoring/presence
REST -> Svc : snapshot()
Svc -> Mem : đọc connections
Svc -> Pub : countAlivePublic()
Mem --> Svc : connections list
Pub --> Svc : số visitor còn TTL
Svc --> REST : { uniqueUsers, publicVisitors, byRole, ts }
REST --> UI : snapshot ban đầu
UI --> Admin : hiển thị số online

== 2. Realtime updates qua WebSocket ==

UI -> WS : io('/admin/monitoring').connect()

note over WS, Svc
  Khi user khác login/logout:
  - WS handleConnection → add(conn)
  - WS handleDisconnect → remove(socketId)
end note

WS -> Svc : add(conn) hoặc remove(socketId)
Svc -> Svc : notify() — tính snapshot mới
Svc -> WS : emit('presence:updated', snap)
WS --> UI : socket event
UI --> Admin : cập nhật số online (animation)

== 3. Public visitor heartbeat (mỗi 30s) ==

note over Svc
  usePublicPresence hook
  POST /public/presence/heartbeat
end note

Svc -> Pub : pingPublic(visitorId)
Pub -> Pub : refresh lastSeenAt

@enduml
